                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "226649918",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198061402522",
                            "num_reviews": 14,
                            "playtime_forever": 484,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 484,
                            "last_played": 1779210847
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I can't describe in words how many hours I have lost to this game and how painful it is for me to play right now.. I played this game when it first came out and had way too many \"Oh shit, I have to work in the morning!\" moments with it. Functionally, it's still viable, but technically it has fallen way behind the times.\n\nWhoever owns this IP now, needs to wake up. You're still selling this game and taking money from people, but you haven't modernized it in any way. If you read the discussions, there are folks who can't even play the game due to CtD failures. For some, it won't even launch, let alone crash. \n\nThe game does not support modern monitors, HDR or any of the modern basic graphics settings. You have to modify the .cfg just to tell the game to run in windowed mode.\n\nThey released an overhaul update in ~2014 or so, it's time for a refresh. At this point, they're just stealing money from gamers who want a sniff of nostalgia, or maybe are trying to pass on a legacy to the next generation.\n\nDo better.",
